@node band-split Plugin Parameters
@section Parameters

This plugin has no user-tunable parameters.


@strong{Structural parameters} (Frequency, Type) require rebuilding the plugin when changed. Other parameters update in real-time with zero dropout.

@node band-split Plugin Developer Guide
@section Developer Guide

SOTF Band Split plugin for splitting a signal into frequency bands.

Splits an audio signal into multiple frequency bands using Linkwitz-Riley crossover filters for phase-coherent band separation.

@subsubheading Parameter wiring

All parameters reach the audio thread through the host's @code{rebuild_cached_parameters} / @code{set_parameter} / @code{get_parameter} triad. Structural parameters (marked in the notes below) trigger a rebuild; the rest update in real time with zero dropouts.

